{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126022539067-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126023446\"/><p>大老山隧道往九龍方向管道有兩車相撞。</p><p>今日(26日)凌晨2時許，大老山隧道往九龍方向管道近入口位置有兩車發生碰撞，受事件影響，往九龍方向管道受阻。意外中，有3人受傷，暫未知需否送院治理。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T18:44:19.263287+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T18:25:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:37:47.590206+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T18:37:47.590206+00:00","content_hash":"92249605b96ce13850020ded16410357adae824b976f3cbfdfb8ce8e604f70a8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}